<title>CUBA: Cuban ambassador among hostages in Peru.</title>
<headline>Cuban ambassador among hostages in Peru.</headline>
<dateline>HAVANA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cuba's ambassador to Peru, Pedro Diaz Arcia, is among the hostages being held by Peruvian guerrillas who stormed the Japanese ambassador's residence in Lima, a Cuban government source said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;He is among the hostages,&quot; the source, who asked not to be identified, said.</p>
<p>He added the Cuban authorities were closely monitoring the situation at the Japanese ambassador's residence in Lima, which was raided by heavily-armed Tupac Amaru Revolutionary Movement (MRTA) guerrillas on Tuesday night.</p>
</text>
